AU  - Di Prospero, Carolina
AU  - Ojeda, Natalia
TI  - Digital transformation, innovation, and prison policy: The implementation of decision support systems in Argentina and Chile
T2  - PAPELES DE TRABAJO
M3  - Article
AB  - The national digital transformation strategies implemented in recent years within state orga-nizations responsible for prison management in Latin America share a common trend: the in-corporation of decision-support systems at various levels. However, they differ significantly in terms of the origins of these state initiatives, the motivations behind their design, and the processes involved in their implementation. This article aims to describe two of such experiences (Argentina and Chile), considering the different contexts in which they developed, in order to assess both the current scope and future challenges of organizational learning and innovation processes within the framework of prison policies in the region.
