TI  - The seriousness and politics (or policy of the seriousness). Around the Chilean political formalism pre 1973 dictatorship
T2  - IZQUIERDAS
M3  - Article
AB  - The following article deals with the political and social environment during the 60's and 70's, revealing the protocols of a serious world, a mechanism of social truth and a weapon of political subversion in order to have access to power. The rhetoric of seriousness, as a contrast with "evanescent behaviours" coming from the happy and festive world, announces a political ethos of the militant and doctrinal discipline, useful in the pretensions of imposing a global nation project.
